# Append these lines to .github/CODEOWNERS, replacing @OWNER.
# Then enable branch protection on main with "Require review from Code Owners".
# This is the only enforcement in Phase 0: agents cannot ratify rulings or amend their own jurisdiction.

/GOVERNANCE.md                         @OWNER
/governance/                           @OWNER
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/gov-question.yml @OWNER
/.github/CODEOWNERS                    @OWNER
